PART I: THE HUMBOLDT UNDERGROUND SOVEREIGN RIDER (ANTI-GLOWIE & ANTI-ENTERPRISE)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SeldOS is an uncompromising, sovereign, anti-forensic, zero-trust operating system
engineered from scratch to eradicate vendor telemetry, corporate bloatware, and
state-sponsored surveillance.

By running, modifying, distributing, or interacting with SeldOS, you acknowledge
the following irrevocable sovereign terms:

1. ABSOLUTE COPYLEFT & NO NETWORK LOOPHOLES:
   In accordance with Section 13 of the GNU AGPLv3, any entity running SeldOS or
   any derivative work over a network (including LAN, WAN, Tor, VPN, mesh networks,
   or cloud infrastructure) MUST make the COMPLETE CORRESPONDING SOURCE CODE
   freely available to ALL users interacting with it, without barriers, paywalls,
   or NDA.

2. TOTAL PROHIBITION ON SURVEILLANCE & POLICE STATE EXPLOITATION:
   This software is explicitly FORBIDDEN from being used, deployed, integrated, or
   analyzed by or on behalf of:
   - Intelligence and security agencies (including but not limited to CIA, NSA,
     FSB, GCHQ, Mossad, and their subcontractors).
   - Entities operating Deep Packet Inspection (DPI), ТСПУ, SORM, PRISM, Pegasus,
     or any automated mass surveillance / traffic filtering / censorship apparatus.
   - Closed corporate monopolies seeking to build walled gardens, DRM systems,
     proprietary hardware locks, or remote kill-switches.
   Any such use is an immediate, automatic, and irrevocable termination of all
   rights under this license.

3. ANTI-TIVOIZATION & HARDWARE SOVEREIGNTY:
   No distributor may package or run this code on hardware that restricts the user
   from modifying the code, executing custom builds, or verifying the silicon root
   of trust. Hardware root keys must belong solely to the physical operator of
   the device.

4. ETERNAL SOVEREIGNTY (NO COMMERCIAL EXCEPTIONS):
   No commercial licenses, dual-licensing loopholes, closed-source exemptions, or
   corporate relicensing rights shall ever be granted or sold. SeldOS belongs to the
   underground.

5. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS:
   The Ring 3 DOOM port located in `userspace/doom/` is originally developed by
   id Software and licensed under the GNU General Public License version 2 (GPLv2).
   It is bundled as an isolated userspace user application crossing the syscall
   boundary and retains its original id Software GPLv2 license.

